msgstr "Haikwanisi kuchengetedza chimiro chechiso"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan muenzaniso wechipiri"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Hatina kukwanisa kurekodha modhi yechipiri"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Yako yekutanga modhi yakachengetwa, saka face login yatoshanda. Ita sh"
"uwa kuti chiso chako chakavhenekerwa zvakanaka uye pakati, woedza zvak"
"are -- kana kusvetuka wowedzera modhi gare gare kubva kuSettings."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Wedzera chimiro chechiso (inodiwa)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Kupinda kwechiso kunoda modhi imwe chete yechiso, saka scan iyi haigon"
"e kusvetuka. Rekodha muchiedza chaunowanzogara mariri. Mwenje unochinj"
"a matarisiro anoita chiso chako kukhamera, saka funga kuwedzera imwe m"
"odhi gare gare kubva kuSettings, yakarekodhwa nechiedza chakasiyana (s"
"omuenzaniso marambi emanheru pachinzvimbo chemasikati)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Wedzera yechipiri chiso modhi (inokurudzirwa)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Yako yekutanga modhi yakachengetwa. Kuvheneka kunoshandura mataridzike"
" chiso chako kukhamera: modhi yakarekodhwa masikati inogona kupera man"
"heru pasi pemarambi (kana neimwe nzira kutenderera), uye Ubuntu Hello "
"yobva yabuda pane kuvhura. Muenzaniso wechipiri wakanyorwa muchiedza c"
"hakasiyana unochengeta kuzivikanwa kwakavimbika chero nguva yezuva."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Chinja mwenje kutanga: chinja mwenje wekamuri kana mwenje wedhesiki ub"
"atidze kana kudzima, furatira hwindo, kana pfeka magirazi aunopfeka dz"
"imwe nguva. Wobva watarisa zvakananga mukamera uye wodzvanya Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Setup"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi"
" hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Kutarisa TPM"
" hardware uye maturusi..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi"
" hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware"
" yaonekwa. Kuisa <i>tpm2-tools</i> otomatiki..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi"
" hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM"
" 2.0 inoshanda. Password yako ichavharwa zvakachengeteka mukati meTPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi"
" hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware"
" yaonekwa, asi kuiswa kwe<i>tpm2-tools</i> otomatiki kwatadza. Mhanya "
"<code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Kudzokera kune software-base"
"d credential caching."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi"
" hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hapana TPM h"
"ardware yaonekwa. Kushandisa software-based credential caching (AES-25"
"6-GCM)."

