#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ita kuti huchokwadi hwechiso kuti uvhure otomatiki kiyi yako yekupinda"
" kana KWallet paunopinda. Izvi zvinochengetedza password yako yakavhar"
"wa muTPM kana iripo, kana yakavharidzirwa ne AES-256-GCM uchishandisa "
"midzi-chete master kiyi. Face auth set PAM_AUTHTOK ye pam_gnome_keyrin"
"g kana pam_kwallet5 zvichienderana nedesktop yako."

